    "name": "savemaster",
    "author": "dsfwxp",
    "description": "A plugin mod for Mindustry that gives you more control over your saves: back up and restore a whole save (maps, schematics and progress settings included), edit the maps inside a save or a backup without leaving the game, keep several independent players on one device, and sync a save between devices with a cloud save server you host yourself. It adds no game content and does not affect net multiplayer. More details in the GitHub repo.",
